{"@context":{"lean":"lean:","block":"block:","imports":{"@type":"@id"}},"@graph":[{"@id":"lean:module:QOU.Mass.PaddedShapeLevelRational","@type":"LeanModule","name":"QOU.Mass.PaddedShapeLevelRational","imports":["lean:module:Init","lean:module:QOU.MathlibExt.QPartitionCombinatorics","lean:module:Mathlib.Algebra.BigOperators.Group.Finset.Basic"],"declarations":16,"chunks":1},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Mass.PaddedShapeLevelRational.qDim_cons_level_rational","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Mass.PaddedShapeLevelRational.qDim_cons_level_rational","kind":"theorem","line":239,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Mass/PaddedShapeLevelRational.lean#L239-L266","doc":"**Unconditional level-rationality of the padded q-dimension**: for every `μ` with\nparts `≤ B` and first row `B + t` (i.e. `μ[n]` at level `n = |μ| + B + t`),\n\n  `qDim q ((B+t) :: μ) = ∏_{i<K} [n − i]_q / D`,   `K = |μ| + B`,\n\nwith `D` the level-independent row-0-window × `hookProd μ` factor. The hook-split\nhypothesis of `qdim_level_rational_of_hook_split` is discharged by\n`hookProd_cons_split` — no conditional input remains. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Mass.PaddedShapeLevelRational.hookProd_cons_split","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Mass.PaddedShapeLevelRational.hookProd_cons_split","kind":"theorem","line":207,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Mass/PaddedShapeLevelRational.lean#L207-L237","doc":"**The general hook split** (the §10 probe's 99/99 fact, proved for every shape):\nfor `μ` with all parts `≤ B` and first row `B + t`,\n\n  `hookProd q ((B+t) :: μ) = (∏_{j<B} [hook₀(j)]_q · [t]_q!) · hookProd q μ`,\n\nwhere `hook₀(j)` is the row-0 hook. The first row is parametrized as `B + t` (rather\nthan `r` with `B ≤ r`) so no ℕ-subtraction rewriting is needed; no sortedness of `μ`\nis assumed. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Mass.PaddedShapeLevelRational.prod_desc_eq_qFactorial","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Mass.PaddedShapeLevelRational.prod_desc_eq_qFactorial","kind":"theorem","line":197,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Mass/PaddedShapeLevelRational.lean#L197-L205","doc":"The descending bracket product is the q-factorial:\n`∏_{j<T} [T−j]_q = [T]_q!`. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Mass.PaddedShapeLevelRational.qFactorial_eq_prod_range","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Mass.PaddedShapeLevelRational.qFactorial_eq_prod_range","kind":"theorem","line":188,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Mass/PaddedShapeLevelRational.lean#L188-L195","doc":"`[N]_q!` as a range product of brackets. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Mass.PaddedShapeLevelRational.hookProd_eq_prod","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Mass.PaddedShapeLevelRational.hookProd_eq_prod","kind":"theorem","line":173,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Mass/PaddedShapeLevelRational.lean#L173-L186","doc":"`hookProd` in `Finset.prod` form. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Mass.PaddedShapeLevelRational.foldl_mul_eq_prod","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Mass.PaddedShapeLevelRational.foldl_mul_eq_prod","kind":"theorem","line":160,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Mass/PaddedShapeLevelRational.lean#L160-L171","doc":"Fold-to-product bridge: the multiplicative `List.range` fold is a `Finset.prod`. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Mass.PaddedShapeLevelRational.hookLength_cons_zero","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Mass.PaddedShapeLevelRational.hookLength_cons_zero","kind":"theorem","line":152,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Mass/PaddedShapeLevelRational.lean#L152-L158","doc":"Row-0 hook of the padded shape at column `j < r`:\n`arm + leg + 1 = (r − j − 1) + leg_j(μ) + 1`. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Mass.PaddedShapeLevelRational.hookLength_cons_succ","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Mass.PaddedShapeLevelRational.hookLength_cons_succ","kind":"theorem","line":147,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Mass/PaddedShapeLevelRational.lean#L147-L150","doc":"**Prepending a first row leaves lower-row hooks unchanged** — definitionally:\n`get?` and `drop` on a cons reduce structurally, and legs only count rows below. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Mass.PaddedShapeLevelRational.legCount_eq_zero","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Mass.PaddedShapeLevelRational.legCount_eq_zero","kind":"theorem","line":131,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Mass/PaddedShapeLevelRational.lean#L131-L145","doc":"Legs vanish beyond a column bound: if every part of `μ` is `≤ B` and `B ≤ j`,\ncolumn `j` has no legs. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Mass.PaddedShapeLevelRational.legCount","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Mass.PaddedShapeLevelRational.legCount","kind":"def","line":127,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Mass/PaddedShapeLevelRational.lean#L127-L129","doc":"Leg count of column `j` (0-indexed) in `μ`: the number of parts exceeding `j` —\nexactly the `legLen` filter of `Partition.hookLength`. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Mass.PaddedShapeLevelRational.qdim_level_rational_of_hook_split","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Mass.PaddedShapeLevelRational.qdim_level_rational_of_hook_split","kind":"theorem","line":94,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Mass/PaddedShapeLevelRational.lean#L94-L111","doc":"**Level-rationality of the padded q-dimension** (conditional on the hook split).\nIf the hook product of `λ = μ[n]` splits off the tail q-factorial —\n`hookProd q λ = [|λ|−K]_q! · D` with `K = |μ|+μ₁` and `D` the level-independent\nshifted-bracket × `H_q(μ)` factor (the probe-verified combinatorial input, 99/99 exact\nfor `|μ| ≤ 4`, `n ≤ 12`) — then\n\n  `qDim q λ = ∏_{i<K} [|λ|−i]_q / D`,\n\na fixed rational function of `(q, q^{|λ|})`: the per-shape Deligne/TL restriction\nproperty. The interpolation-vs-feasibility verdict (audit §10): this per-shape\nrationality is exact, while the *sum* over the growing shape set escapes it — the\nstable truncation captures a collapsing fraction of `T_q(n)` at `q₀`. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Mass.PaddedShapeLevelRational.qFactorial_div_telescope","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Mass.PaddedShapeLevelRational.qFactorial_div_telescope","kind":"theorem","line":86,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Mass/PaddedShapeLevelRational.lean#L86-L92","doc":"Division form at `1 < q` (where `[n−K]_q! ≠ 0`):\n`[n]_q! / ([n−K]_q! · D) = ∏_{i<K} [n−i]_q / D`. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Mass.PaddedShapeLevelRational.qFactorial_mul_telescope","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Mass.PaddedShapeLevelRational.qFactorial_mul_telescope","kind":"theorem","line":79,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Mass/PaddedShapeLevelRational.lean#L79-L84","doc":"Division-free form of the telescope, for downstream `rw` without nonzero\nhypotheses. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Mass.PaddedShapeLevelRational.qFactorial_telescope","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Mass.PaddedShapeLevelRational.qFactorial_telescope","kind":"theorem","line":63,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Mass/PaddedShapeLevelRational.lean#L63-L77","doc":"**q-factorial telescope**: `[n]_q! = [n−k]_q! · ∏_{i<k} [n−i]_q` for `k ≤ n`.\nThe algebraic heart of padded-shape level-rationality: the last `k` brackets of the\nq-factorial form a fixed-size window sliding with `n`. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Mass.PaddedShapeLevelRational.qDim_eq_fact_div_hookProd","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Mass.PaddedShapeLevelRational.qDim_eq_fact_div_hookProd","kind":"theorem","line":59,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Mass/PaddedShapeLevelRational.lean#L59-L61","doc":"`qDim` is definitionally the q-factorial over the named hook product. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Mass.PaddedShapeLevelRational.hookProd","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Mass.PaddedShapeLevelRational.hookProd","kind":"def","line":50,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Mass/PaddedShapeLevelRational.lean#L50-L57","doc":"The hook product `∏_{x ∈ λ} [h_x]_q` — the denominator fold of `qDim`, named. ","signatureChunk":0}]}